  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_newberrye_whites_cb6087943b2f833c51a8e5ac4acfe0f76283e9c6372763b8ff37778f39b765c861">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>(Neubery whightes) an English woollen | is an English woollen cloth, reckoned three to a short cloth of assize (Jenks 2024, p. 124), but the meaning of kotyes is unknown</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
